《老爸老妈浪漫史》由乔什·拉德纳和克雷格·托马斯主持并担任执行制片人。

01:22:22.569 --> 01:22:28.250
The show was produced by me, Alec Lev, and our co-producer is Doug Matica.
本节目由我、亚历克·莱夫制作，我们的联合制作人是道格·马蒂卡。

01:22:28.250 --> 01:22:37.471
Our audio producer and mixer is Alex Reeves at Point of Blue Studios, and our digital content producer AKA Gen Z Master is Emily Blumberg.
我们的音频制作人和混音师是 Point of Blue Studios 的亚历克斯·里夫斯，我们的数字内容制作人兼 Z 世代大师是艾米莉·布伦贝格。

01:22:37.471 --> 01:22:39.007
Artwork by John Morrow.
封面插图由约翰·莫罗绘制。

01:22:39.007 --> 01:22:45.088
Please follow, rate and review the show on Apple Podcasts or your podcast player of choice.
请在苹果播客或你选择的播客播放器上关注、评分和评论本节目。

01:22:45.088 --> 01:22:47.026
It really does help the show.
这确实对节目很有帮助。

01:22:47.026 --> 01:22:53.841
Our theme song is NYC by our own Josh Radner with additional music by Craig Thomas and Andrew Majuski.
我们的主题曲是《NYC》，由我们自己的乔什·拉德纳创作，克雷格·托马斯和安德鲁·马朱斯基提供额外音乐。

01:22:53.841 --> 01:22:57.182
Special thanks to Lola Kennedy and Elliot Connors.
特别感谢萝拉·肯尼迪和埃利奥特·康纳斯。

01:22:57.182 --> 01:23:03.998
Visit HowWeMajorMother.com to sign up for our Substack mailing list and for links to our social media.
访问 HowWeMajorMother.com 注册我们的 Substack 邮件列表，并获取我们社交媒体的链接。

01:23:03.998 --> 01:23:09.210
You can also click on the contact page to send us an email or a voice message.
你也可以点击联系页面给我们发送电子邮件或语音留言。

01:23:09.210 --> 01:23:13.286
Your stories and questions are an important part of the show.
你的故事和问题是本节目的重要组成部分。

01:23:13.286 --> 01:23:14.355
Want some merch?
想要一些周边吗？

01:23:14.355 --> 01:23:18.097
Click on the store link or go to HowYouGetYourMerch.com.
点击商店链接或访问 HowYouGetYourMerch.com。

01:23:18.097 --> 01:23:31.060
Subscribe to Josh Radner's Muse Letters on Substack, Order Craig Thomas's debut novel at CraigThomasWriter.com slash novel, and you could subscribe to my Dead Father's Society, also on Substack.
在 Substack 上订阅乔什·拉德纳的 Muse Letters，在 CraigThomasWriter.com/novel 订购克雷格·托马斯的处女作小说，你也可以订阅我的 Dead Father's Society，同样在 Substack 上。

01:23:31.060 --> 01:23:39.279
To learn about how you make a difference, this shows ongoing campaign to raise money for congenital heart disease research.
要了解如何为之做出贡献，本节目正在进行为先天性心脏病研究筹款的长期活动。

01:23:39.279 --> 01:23:43.422
Check out the Make a Difference tab at the top of our website.
请查看我们网站顶部的“做出改变”标签页。

01:23:43.422 --> 01:23:47.899
This episode was made possible by the support of Backyard Ventures.
本集的播出得到了 Backyard Ventures 的支持。

01:23:47.899 --> 01:23:49.769
People will, in fact, dance.
事实上，人们会跳舞的。
